Output pb-create-project.gif

Set FontSize 30
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 0.3

Type "echo 'How to set up a project with pb'"
Sleep 1500ms

Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "pb create-project cool-project-template myproject"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type@500ms "cd myproject"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "pb add-module test-module"
Enter
Sleep 8s
